  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Voices for Inclusive Development: Strengthening CSOs from Uzbekistan working with women and youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To contribute to strengthening the role of local Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) as governance and development actors in Uzbekistan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective 1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To increase the capacities of 15 local CSOs in Samarkand, Namangan and Tashkent working with PLWH (people living with HIV) and people affected by HIV with a view of performing their role as independent development actors more effectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective 2:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To address stigma and discrimination of PLWH and people affected by HIV (with focus on women and youth) through coordinated actions by CSOs working through a multilevel approach.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
